I scroll down on my phone.
The sentences on the website are very impersonal.
Mostly I read short instructions.
I tap on "Edit".
A new text box appears.
"Please enter your new email address."
I type in my current address.
Then I read the next line.
"Click here."
I press the blue button.
The screen loads for a moment.
Then the text changes.
Now the language is very official.
"Your data is being verified."
"A code is being sent to your phone."
I lean back on the sofa.
I wait for the message.
Normally a code like this arrives immediately.
I look at my phone, but it does not vibrate.
